msgid "The implementation of this requirement MUST be executed autonomously by the agent following the iteration loops defined in [Compose Loop](../agents/action/iteration/compose.md) (for changes inside any `roles/<role>/`) and [Workflow Loop](../agents/action/iteration/workflow.md) (for changes to `.github/workflows/test-deploy-swarm-nfs.yml` and any other workflow this touches). The following rules apply for the entire run and are non-negotiable:"
